{"unit_id":"Vergil-long__dsh-email-notify#card-zh","repo":"Vergil-long/dsh-email-notify","commit":"dcc17aa999d941079f07b7d30f0b5698bc6054d0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-email-notify（DSH 插件，web 客户端）：在你离开电脑时，通过邮件告知会话回合结束、工具等待授权或助手等待回答。插件接入会话事件，并在会话页头提供离开模式开关，在设置面板编辑邮箱、SMTP、通知选项和邮件模板。邮件支持摘要、状态和问题选项等内容，也可预览模板。适合需要暂时离开 DSH 界面、仍想及时处理任务的人。需要配置可用的 SMTP 邮箱账号和授权码。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:150-180","lib/index.js:622-640","client/client.js:850-900"]}
{"unit_id":"Vergil-long__dsh-email-notify#card-en","repo":"Vergil-long/dsh-email-notify","commit":"dcc17aa999d941079f07b7d30f0b5698bc6054d0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-email-notify is a DSH web plugin that emails you when a session turn ends, a tool awaits approval, or the assistant needs an answer. Its header Away Mode switch controls sending; the settings panel configures SMTP and editable, previewable templates. Set up an SMTP mailbox and credential.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:150-180","lib/index.js:622-640","client/client.js:850-900"]}
